# Redirects for Netlify

# HTTP to HTTPS redirect
http://info-chir.org/*    https://info-chir.org/:splat    301!
http://www.info-chir.org/*    https://info-chir.org/:splat    301!

# PostHog first-party proxy (ad-blocker resistant analytics; must precede SPA catch-all)
/ingest/static/*  https://us-assets.i.posthog.com/static/:splat  200
/ingest/*  https://us.i.posthog.com/:splat  200

# Serve all routes from index.html for SPA routing
/*    /index.html   200
